  {
   "heading": "Avoir — to have",
   "body": "*Avoir* is the other key irregular verb. Note the liaison with *nous*, *vous*, *ils* and *elles*: the s is pronounced as a z before the vowel.\n\nListen carefully: *ils sont* (they are) has an **s** sound, *ils ont* (they have) has a **z** sound.",
